.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt INIT 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm init
.Nd RavenBSD PID 1
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
program is the first user process started by the kernel.
In the M1 milestone it prints the boot banner and the
.Xr uname 1
identification line, then exits.
.Pp
Later milestones supervise the service manifests described in
.Xr service 5
and the system servers.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
